# Hive engineering states

Do not claim DONE / working / wired / live / verified without the gate.

Contract: `docs/hive/outer-heaven/CONTENT/os/ENGINEERING.md`
Jobs: `docs/hive/outer-heaven/CONTENT/os/jobs/`
Command: `python3 scripts/hive/eng/hive-job.py verify --job <id>`

A file, unit test, typecheck, commit, or status line cannot advance a runtime capability past `IMPLEMENTED_UNVERIFIED`.
Builder ≠ verifier. Cursor does not stamp its own `VERIFIED`.
Face down → `VERIFICATION_UNAVAILABLE`, not PASS.
Slack / session folders are continuity. They are not the engineering SSOT.
Hard step (send / pay / deploy / book / publish) stays Evens.
